ot, leaving Republican Jennifer Balkcom to face Democrat Jamie Ager, a farmer running as a 'Mountain Democrat.' The district leans Republican by about five points, but the open-seat dynamic and a favorable national environment have put it in play.\n\nAger has raised roughly $5.9 million to Balkcom's $0.4 million, and outside groups have spent heavily against her while PACs have canceled some planned ad buys. Recent polls show Ager ahead by six to thirteen points, and prediction markets price his win probability around 80-84%. Expert raters overwhelmingly call the race a Democratic flip, though a few label it a tossup. The forecast lands on a Democratic edge of about six points, with meaningful uncertainty given the district's Republican lean and thin polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5972, "margin": 1.39}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6249, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6236, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6239, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5922, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5614, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6011, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6565, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6466, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.684, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6607, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6845, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6944, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6524, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6027, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.5927, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6347, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6298, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6269, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6209, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.6546, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6842, 